-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The TuneHub runtime contains no third-party dependencies. Audio synthesis,
scheduling, offline rendering, and WAV encoding use native browser Web Audio
APIs and ES modules.

Development and test tools not distributed with this project:
  - Node.js (used to run tests and the local static server)

Archived content:
  - prototype/original-demo.html is the project's starting example. It is not
    original TuneHub code and is retained for historical reference only; it is
    not part of the distributed product.

Third-party projects mentioned in docs/archive/ (including Tone.js,
sonic-weave, Strudel, Scale Workshop, and generative.fm) have not been copied
into this repository. They are cited by name and link in research notes only;
all rights remain with their respective authors.
